  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Temperature and volume curves are drawn for&nbsp;two thermodynamic processes. For the first process, it is a straight line and for the second, it is a rectangular hyperbola. The ratio of work done in the first process to the work done in the second process is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013421_Question_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 141px;\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
