  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013421_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 120px;\" /><br />The first process is a constant pressure process, hence<br />w<sub>1</sub> = nR(2T<sub>0</sub> - T<sub>0</sub>) = nRT<sub>0</sub><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013421_AnsExp_2.jpg\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 129px;\" /><br />The equation for the second process is<br /><math><mrow><mtext>T</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>nRT</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>nRc</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>w</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <munderover> <mo>∫</mo> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> </munderover> <mtext>PdV</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>nRT</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>w</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>w</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2&nbsp;</mn> <mtext>:&nbsp;</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math><br />∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2 : 1",
    "image": null
  },
